%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24cee7e49fc532a45ab71bd5ace6cb7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: S1pre
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: You never know which goodbye is the last one until it's long
      past.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uC778\uC0AC\uB294 \uB298 \uC9C0\uB09C \uB4A4\uC5D0\uC57C
      \uC54C\uAC8C \uB41C\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 67b5dd471d2fdea4eb0322b8c9ef0b5b, type: 3}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: In a land dry for decades now, the faces beside me slipped away
      like sand between my fingers.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBA87\uC2ED \uB144\uC9F8 \uAC70\uC758 \uB9D0\uB77C\uBC84\uB9B0
      \uC774 \uB545\uC5D0\uC11C, \uACC1\uC5D0 \uC788\uB358 \uC5BC\uAD74\uB4E4\uC740
      \uC190\uAC00\uB77D \uC0AC\uC774 \uBAA8\uB798\uCC98\uB7FC \uBE60\uC838\uB098\uAC14\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: Piper was the brightest of them, and the biggest dreamer.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C\uB294 \uADF8\uC911\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uAC00\uC7A5
      \uBC1D\uACE0 \uB0AD\uB9CC\uC801\uC778 \uC544\uC774\uC600\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: She never stopped talking, and yet she'd spend long stretches
      staring up at the blue sky, gone quiet and far away.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB140\uB294 \uB9D0\uC774 \uCC38 \uB9CE\uC73C\uBA74\uC11C\uB3C4,
      \uC885\uC885 \uD30C\uB780 \uD558\uB298\uC744 \uD55C\uCC38 \uC62C\uB824\uB2E4\uBCF4\uBA70
      \uAC00\uB9CC\uD788 \uC0DD\uAC01\uC5D0 \uC7A0\uAE30\uAE30\uB3C4 \uD588\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: "And then she'd be right back at it, pestering me \u2014 didn't
      that cloud look just like something or other?"
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7EC\uB2E4\uAC00\uB3C4 \uAC00\uB054 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294
      \uAD6C\uB984\uC774 \uAF2D \uBB34\uC5C7\uCC98\uB7FC \uC0DD\uAE30\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC558\uB0D0\uACE0
      \uB2E4\uC2DC \uADC0\uCC2E\uAC8C \uC7AC\uC798\uAC70\uB838\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: So the wellside without her was quieter than it had any right
      to be.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB798\uC11C \uADF8 \uC560\uAC00 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC6B0\uBB3C\uAC00\uB294
      \uC774\uD1A0\uB85D \uC870\uC6A9\uD560 \uC218\uAC00 \uC5C6\uC5C8\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: She was already gone, and in the end only her voice stayed behind,
      somewhere inside me.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB140\uB294 \uC774\uBBF8 \uB5A0\uB0AC\uACE0, \uACB0\uAD6D
      \uB9C8\uC74C\uC18D\uC5D0 \uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC\uB9CC \uB0A8\uC558\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: "And the one left behind would carry that voice for years and
      years, until one day even that\u2014"
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB0A8\uC740 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC740 \uADF8 \uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC\uB97C
      \uC624\uB798\uC624\uB798 \uD488\uACE0 \uB2E4\uB2C8\uB2E4\uAC00, \uC5B4\uB290
      \uB0A0\uC5D4 \uADF8\uB9C8\uC800\u2014"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: ...What are you even talking about?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\u2026\u2026\uBB50\uB77C\uB294 \uAC70\uC57C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0c713d599beb9344b4ee106a4240d3b, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Um, I'm right here? ...Did the heat finally get to her?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC800 \uC5EC\uAE30 \uC788\uAC70\uB4E0\uC694? ...\uB354\uC704
      \uBA39\uC5C8\uB098?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f35fe2d75bd44f144b4e061c950e5fe3, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: Piper was standing there with an empty bucket in one hand and
      a look of pure disbelief on her face. Perfectly fine. On both feet.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C\uAC00 \uBE48 \uBB3C\uD1B5\uC744 \uD55C \uC190\uC5D0
      \uB4E0 \uCC44, \uC5B4\uC774\uC5C6\uB2E4\uB294 \uC5BC\uAD74\uB85C \uC11C \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4.
      \uBA40\uCA61\uD788, \uB450 \uBC1C\uB85C."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Oh. You're back.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B4, \uC654\uAD6C\uB098."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 804f4937427d73c438fd059b9f112a8f, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Faster than I expected. You could've taken your time.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC0DD\uAC01\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uBE68\uB9AC \uC654\uB124. \uC880 \uB354
      \uCC9C\uCC9C\uD788 \uC640\uB3C4 \uB410\uB294\uB370."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 45ba7650e66fc1349bc111d80a881bb0, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Taken my time? What, so you could finish my funeral first?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC880 \uB354 \uCC9C\uCC9C\uD788 \uC640\uC694? \uC81C \uC7A5\uB840\uC2DD\uC774\uB77C\uB3C4
      \uB9C8\uC800 \uCE58\uB974\uC2DC\uAC8C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0c713d599beb9344b4ee106a4240d3b, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: ...So how was the well over there? Any water at all?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "...\uC800\uCABD \uC6B0\uBB3C\uC740 \uC5B4\uB560\uC5B4? \uBB3C\uC774
      \uC870\uAE08\uC774\uB77C\uB3C4 \uB098\uC624\uB294 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC544?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 804f4937427d73c438fd059b9f112a8f, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Unbelievable... No, that one's hopeless too.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uCC38 \uB098... \uC800\uCABD\uB3C4 \uAC00\uB9DD\uC774 \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0c713d599beb9344b4ee106a4240d3b, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Look at this. I couldn't fill it at all. How about yours?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC774\uAC70 \uBD10\uC694. \uC870\uAE08\uB3C4 \uBABB \uCC44\uC6E0\uC796\uC544\uC694.
      \uD14C\uC0AC \uCABD\uC740\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e0d48381d94c0714ba8e3bdddc9c5eaa, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Nothing right now, but look here. Doesn't it feel like it'd burst
      if you hit it just right?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uC548 \uB098\uC624\uB294\uB370, \uC5EC\uAE30
      \uBCF4\uBA74 \uC798 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uBA74 \uD130\uC838 \uB098\uC62C \uAC83
      \uAC19\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC544?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 45ba7650e66fc1349bc111d80a881bb0, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Oh, you're right. So why weren't you working on it?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B4, \uADF8\uB7EC\uB124\uC694? \uADFC\uB370 \uC65C \uC791\uC5C5
      \uC548 \uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce46d5e3f69096f4a84f9897353ff324, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: You're better with your hands these days. I was waiting on our
      ace.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC694\uC998\uC5D4 \uB108\uAC00 \uB354 \uC190\uC7AC\uC8FC\uAC00
      \uC88B\uC796\uC544. \uC6B0\uB9AC \uC5D0\uC774\uC2A4\uB97C \uAE30\uB2E4\uB9AC\uACE0
      \uC788\uC5C8\uC9C0."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9efc6fe7a790fc8428194a75c40098e7, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: You just couldn't be bothered...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uADC0\uCC2E\uC558\uB358 \uAC70\uBA74\uC11C..."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0c713d599beb9344b4ee106a4240d3b, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
